@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Alarm Clock

[*] --> Off

state "Off" as Off
state "Alarm Set" as AlarmSet
state "Ringing" as Ringing

Off --> AlarmSet : set alarm time
AlarmSet --> Ringing : current time matches alarm time
Ringing --> Off : stop alarm

Ringing --> [*] : alarm stopped, next scheduled alarm

@enduml
